<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex and Debica closed lower while BIG, BRE Stalexport and Universal were flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The other five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>Turnover was 2.3 million zlotys, up from Friday's 1.8 million zlotys.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.7 percent in a 14.5-million-zloty turnover, up from 10.9 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
